## Paid Advertising Strategy
We will use paid advertising to reach our target audience and drive traffic to our landing page. We will use the following paid advertising channels:

1. Google Ads: We will create targeted ads that appear on Google search results and Google Display Network.
2. Facebook Ads: We will create targeted ads that appear on Facebook and Instagram.
3. LinkedIn Ads: We will create targeted ads that appear on LinkedIn.

## Email Marketing Strategy
We will use email marketing to nurture our leads and encourage them to sign up for our Accessibility Checker tool. We will create a series of email campaigns that include the following:

1. Welcome Email: "Thanks for signing up for our Accessibility Checker tool! Here's how to get started."
2. Educational Email: "Learn more about website accessibility and how to improve your user experience."
3. Promotional Email: "Get a discount on our Accessibility Checker tool for a limited time only."

## Metrics for Success
We will track the following metrics to measure the success of our acquisition strategy:

1. Website traffic
2. Landing page conversions
3. Social media engagement
4. Email open rates
5. Customer acquisition cost (CAC)
6. Customer lifetime value (CLV)

By implementing this comprehensive acquisition strategy, we are confident that we can acquire 100 paying customers for the Accessibility Checker tool within the next 6 months.